(5) The period within which such an appeal may be brought shall be ?
(a) fifteen days from the date on which notice of the decision was served on the person desiring to appeal; or (b) in the case of an appeal under sub-section (1), the said period or the period specified in the improvement notice, whichever expires earlier;
It further appears from the perusal of the record that although statutory appeal was preferred by the petitioner as provided under Sub-section 4 of Section 32 of the Act of 2006, the same was rejected by the respondent no. 3 vide order dated 25.09.2019.
